msgstr "SMTP-samtale (adgangskode skjult)"

#: admin/diagnostics-tab.php:41
msgid ""
"Test emails ignore test mode and \"do not send\" mode, so you can check the "
"connection on a staging copy."
msgstr ""
"Test-e-mails ignorerer testtilstand og \"send ikke\"-tilstand, så du kan "
"kontrollere forbindelsen på en staging-kopi."

#: admin/diagnostics-tab.php:45
msgid "Can this server reach the SMTP server?"
msgstr "Kan denne server nå SMTP-serveren?"

#: admin/diagnostics-tab.php:46
msgid ""
"Many hosts block outgoing mail ports. This checks the usual ones to your "
"saved host, from this web server."
msgstr ""
"Mange hosts blokerer udgående mailporte. Dette tjekker de almindelige porte "
"til din gemte host fra denne webserver."

#: admin/diagnostics-tab.php:47
msgid "Check ports"
msgstr "Tjek porte"

#: admin/diagnostics-tab.php:55
#, php-format
msgid "Sender domain: %s"
msgstr "Afsenderdomæne: %s"

#: admin/diagnostics-tab.php:59
msgid "DNS lookups are not available on this server."
msgstr "DNS-opslag er ikke tilgængelige på denne server."

#: admin/diagnostics-tab.php:67
msgid ""
"Make sure it includes this web server (its IP address with ip4: or ip6:, or "
"a: / mx: that resolves to it)."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for, at den omfatter denne webserver (dens IP-adresse med ip4: eller "
"ip6:, eller en a: / mx:-post, der peger på den)."

#: admin/diagnostics-tab.php:69
msgid ""
"Make sure it includes your SMTP provider (for example include:spf.brevo.com)."
msgstr ""
"Sørg for, at den inkluderer din SMTP-udbyder (f.eks. include:spf.brevo.com)."

#: admin/diagnostics-tab.php:72
msgid ""
"No SPF record. Add one at your DNS host that names your SMTP provider, or "
"many inboxes will distrust the email."
msgstr ""
"Ingen SPF-post. Tilføj en hos din DNS-udbyder, der angiver din SMTP-udbyder, "
"ellers vil mange indbakker ikke stole på e-mailen."

#: admin/diagnostics-tab.php:80
msgid ""
"No DMARC record. Gmail and Yahoo require one for bulk senders; even a simple "
"\"v=DMARC1; p=none\" helps."
msgstr ""
"Ingen DMARC-post. Gmail og Yahoo kræver en for afsendere med store "
"udsendelser; selv en enkel \"v=DMARC1; p=none\" hjælper."

#: admin/diagnostics-tab.php:83
msgid ""
"DKIM is set up at your SMTP provider (they give you the DNS record). It "
"cannot be checked from here without the selector name."
msgstr ""
"DKIM er sat op hos din SMTP-udbyder (de giver dig DNS-posten). Det kan ikke "
"kontrolleres herfra uden navnet på selector'en."

