#: admin/settings.php:240
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Email is sent with this server's own mail (PHP mail()), from %s, with a "
"matching Return-Path."
msgstr ""
"E-mail sendes via serverens egen mailfunktion (PHP mail()) fra %s med en "
"matchende Return-Path."

#: admin/settings.php:244
msgid ""
"Return-Path is off: the server puts its own address on the envelope, so SPF "
"checks that domain instead of yours."
msgstr ""
"Return-Path er slået fra: Serveren bruger sin egen adresse på konvolutten, "
"så SPF kontrollerer dette domæne i stedet for dit."

