msgstr "Gem en log over hver e-mail (modtager, emne, status, fejl)"

#: admin/settings.php:460
msgid "Keep message content"
msgstr "Behold beskedindhold"

#: admin/settings.php:462
msgid "Only of failed emails, so they can be resent"
msgstr "Kun for mislykkede e-mails, så de kan sendes igen"

#: admin/settings.php:463
msgid ""
"Of every email (lets you resend anything; the log then holds password-reset "
"links and order details)"
msgstr ""
"For hver e-mail (giver dig mulighed for at gensende alt; loggen indeholder "
"derefter links til nulstilling af adgangskoder og ordreoplysninger)"

#: admin/settings.php:464
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Aldrig"

#: admin/settings.php:468
msgid "Keep entries for"
msgstr "Behold poster i"

#: admin/settings.php:469
msgid "days, then they are deleted automatically"
msgstr "dage, derefter slettes de automatisk"

#: admin/settings.php:475
msgid "Failure alerts"
msgstr "Fejlalarmer"

#: admin/settings.php:476
msgid ""
"At most one alert per hour. The alert email is sent with PHP mail() of this "
"server, because the SMTP server may be the thing that is down."
msgstr ""
"Højst én alarm i timen. Alarm-e-mailen sendes med denne servers PHP mail(), "
"fordi SMTP-serveren kan være den, der er nede."

#: admin/settings.php:479
msgid "Alert email"
msgstr "Alarm-e-mail"

#: admin/settings.php:483
msgid "Webhook URL"
msgstr "Webhook-URL"

#: admin/settings.php:486
msgid ""
"Optional. A Slack or Discord incoming webhook, or your own HTTPS endpoint "
"(JSON with \"text\" and \"content\"). The plugin posts the error text there "
"— nothing else, and only when you set a URL."
msgstr ""
"Valgfrit. En indgående webhook til Slack eller Discord eller dit eget HTTPS-"
"endpoint (JSON med \"text\" og \"content\"). Pluginet sender kun fejlteksten "
"dertil – intet andet, og kun når du angiver en URL."

#: admin/settings.php:506
msgid "Import from another SMTP plugin"
msgstr "Importer fra et andet SMTP-plugin"

#: admin/settings.php:508
msgid ""
"Copies host, port, encryption, username and sender. Passwords stay where "
"they are — enter yours once after importing."
msgstr ""
"Kopierer vært, port, kryptering, brugernavn og afsender. Adgangskoder bliver "
"hvor de er – indtast din egen én gang efter importen."

#: admin/settings.php:514
#, php-format
msgid "Import from %s"
msgstr "Importer fra %s"

#: admin/settings.php:520
msgid ""
"No settings of WP Mail SMTP, FluentSMTP, Easy WP SMTP or Post SMTP were "
"found on this site."
msgstr ""
"Ingen indstillinger fra WP Mail SMTP, FluentSMTP, Easy WP SMTP eller Post "
"SMTP blev fundet på dette websted."

#: admin/settings.php:527
msgid "Download the log (CSV)"
msgstr "Download loggen (CSV)"

#: admin/settings.php:528
msgid "Delete every log entry?"
msgstr "Slette hver logpost?"

#: admin/settings.php:528
msgid "Empty the log"
msgstr "Tøm loggen"

#: admin/settings.php:545
msgid "Is it working for you?"
msgstr "Virker det for dig?"

#: admin/settings.php:546
msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP is free, with nothing locked. If it got your email delivered, a "
"short review helps other people find it."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP er gratis, uden noget låst bag betaling. Hvis det fik din e-mail "
"leveret, hjælper en kort anmeldelse andre med at finde det."

#: admin/settings.php:548
msgid "Leave a review on WordPress.org"
msgstr "Skriv en anmeldelse på WordPress.org"

#: admin/settings.php:552
msgid "Something missing or broken?"
msgstr "Mangler der noget, eller er noget i stykker?"

#: admin/settings.php:553
msgid ""
"Bug reports and ideas are read by the people who build the plugin. Opening "
"these links sends nothing from your site."
msgstr ""
"Fejlrapporter og idéer læses af dem, der bygger pluginet. Når du åbner disse "
"links, sendes intet fra dit websted."

#: admin/settings.php:555
msgid "Ask in the support forum"
msgstr "Spørg i supportforummet"

#: admin/settings.php:556
msgid "Suggest a feature (public roadmap)"
msgstr "Foreslå en funktion (offentlig roadmap)"

#: admin/settings.php:558
msgid ""
"Posting a log line? Remove addresses first — the Test tab already hides the "
"password."
msgstr ""
"Poster du en loglinje? Fjern adresser først – Test-fanen skjuler allerede "
"adgangskoden."

#: admin/settings.php:608 admin/settings.php:629
msgid "You do not have permission to do that."
msgstr "Du har ikke tilladelse til at gøre det."

#: admin/settings.php:612
msgid "Enter a valid recipient address."
msgstr "Indtast en gyldig modtageradresse."

#: includes/alerts.php:48
#, php-format
msgid ""
"%1$s: the main SMTP connection failed and the backup delivered the email. "
"Error: %2$s"
msgstr ""
"%1$s: den primære SMTP-forbindelse fejlede, og backupen leverede e-mailen. "
"Fejl: %2$s"

#: includes/alerts.php:50
#, php-format
msgid "%1$s: an email could not be sent. Error: %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s: en e-mail kunne ikke sendes. Fejl: %2$s"

#: includes/alerts.php:54
#, php-format
msgid "Log entry #%d"
msgstr "Logpost #%d"

#: includes/alerts.php:64
#, php-format
msgid "[%s] Email delivery problem"
msgstr "[%s] Problem med e-maillevering"

#: includes/alerts.php:100
msgid "Email delivery"
msgstr "E-maillevering"

#: includes/alerts.php:115
msgid "Email is sent through SMTP"
msgstr "E-mail sendes via SMTP"

#: includes/alerts.php:118
msgid "Email"
msgstr "E-mail"

#: includes/alerts.php:121
msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP sends this site's email through an authenticated SMTP server."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP sender dette websteds e-mail via en autentificeret SMTP-server."

#: includes/alerts.php:122
msgid "Open Lynbro SMTP"
msgstr "Åbn Lynbro SMTP"

#: includes/alerts.php:128
msgid "Email is sent with PHP mail(), not SMTP"
msgstr "E-mail sendes med PHP mail(), ikke SMTP"

#: includes/alerts.php:129
msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP is active but no SMTP server is set, so email still leaves "
"through PHP mail() and often lands in spam."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP er aktivt, men ingen SMTP-server er sat op, så e-mail sendes "
"stadig via PHP mail() og ender ofte i spam."

#: includes/alerts.php:133
msgid "Email is sent with the server's own mail, with a matching sender"
msgstr ""
"E-mail sendes via serverens egen mailfunktion med en matchende afsender"

#: includes/alerts.php:134
msgid ""
"Lynbro SMTP sends with PHP mail() by your choice and sets the From address "
"and Return-Path on every email. Keep this server in the domain's SPF record."
msgstr ""
"Lynbro SMTP sender via PHP mail() efter dit valg og angiver From-adressen og "
"Return-Path på hver e-mail. Sørg for, at denne server er med i domænets SPF-"
"post."

#: includes/alerts.php:137
msgid "The saved SMTP password can no longer be read"
msgstr "Den gemte SMTP-adgangskode kan ikke længere læses"

#: includes/alerts.php:138
msgid ""
"The site's security keys changed after the password was saved. Enter the "
"SMTP password again."
msgstr ""
"Webstedets sikkerhedsnøgler ændrede sig, efter at adgangskoden blev gemt. "
"Indtast SMTP-adgangskoden igen."

#: includes/alerts.php:145
msgid "Emails failed to send in the last 24 hours"
msgstr "E-mails kunne ikke sendes i løbet af de sidste 24 timer"

#: includes/alerts.php:146
msgid "The main SMTP connection failed in the last 24 hours"
msgstr "Den primære SMTP-forbindelse fejlede i løbet af de sidste 24 timer"

#: includes/alerts.php:153
msgid "Failure alerts by email do not get out"
msgstr "Fejlalarmer via e-mail bliver ikke sendt"

#: includes/alerts.php:159
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The alert email is sent with PHP mail() so that it does not depend on the "
"SMTP server, but PHP mail() failed on this server: %s Use a webhook for "
"alerts, or ask your host to enable mail()."
msgstr ""
"Alarm-e-mailen sendes med PHP mail(), så den ikke afhænger af SMTP-serveren, "
"men PHP mail() fejlede på denne server: %s Brug en webhook til alarmer, "
"eller bed din hostingudbyder om at slå mail() til."

#: includes/alerts.php:180
msgid "Email delivery (7 days)"
msgstr "E-maillevering (7 dage)"

#: includes/alerts.php:197
#, php-format
msgid "Sent: %1$s · Failed: %2$s"
msgstr "Sendt: %1$s · Fejlet: %2$s"

#: includes/alerts.php:204
msgid "No SMTP server is set yet — email is sent with PHP mail()."
msgstr "Ingen SMTP-server er endnu sat op – e-mail sendes med PHP mail()."

#: includes/alerts.php:209
msgid "Show failed"
msgstr "Vis fejlede"

#: includes/class-lynbro-smtp-retry-mailer.php:100
#, php-format
msgid "Main connection: %1$s — Backup connection: %2$s"
msgstr "Primær forbindelse: %1$s – Backup-forbindelse: %2$s"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:35
#, php-format
msgid "Test email from %s"
msgstr "Testmail fra %s"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:38
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This is a test email from %1$s, sent by Lynbro SMTP.\n"
"\n"
"If you can read it, email delivery works.\n"
"\n"
"Sent: %2$s\n"
"Connection: %3$s"
msgstr ""
"Dette er en testmail fra %1$s, sendt af Lynbro SMTP.\n"
"\n"
"Hvis du kan læse den, virker e-maillevering.\n"
"\n"
"Sendt: %2$s\n"
"Forbindelse: %3$s"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:41
msgid "backup"
msgstr "backup"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:41
msgid "main"
msgstr "hoved"

#: includes/diagnostics.php:121
msgid ""
"The server refused the username or password. Gmail, Outlook, Zoho and iCloud "
"need an app password, not the normal one; SendGrid and Brevo need an SMTP/"
"API key."
msgstr ""
"Serveren afviste brugernavnet eller adgangskoden. Gmail, Outlook, Zoho og "
"iCloud kræver en app-adgangskode, ikke den normale; SendGrid og Brevo kræver "
"en SMTP/API-nøgle."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:124
msgid ""
"Microsoft 365 has SMTP sign-in switched off for this mailbox. An "
"administrator can enable \"Authenticated SMTP\" for it, or use a relay "
"service instead."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft 365 har SMTP-login slået fra for denne postkasse. En administrator "
"kan aktivere \"Authenticated SMTP\" for den, eller i stedet bruge en relay-"
"tjeneste."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:127
msgid ""
"The server could not be reached. Many hosts block outgoing ports 25, 465 and "
"587 — run the port check below, then ask your host to open the port or use "
"the one that is open."
msgstr ""
"Serveren kunne ikke nås. Mange hosts blokerer udgående porte 25, 465 og 587 "
"– kør porttjekket nedenfor, og bed derefter din host om at åbne porten eller "
"brug den, der er åben."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:130
msgid ""
"The secure connection failed. Check that port and encryption match (587 = "
"TLS, 465 = SSL). If the server uses a self-signed certificate, untick "
"\"Verify the server certificate\"."
msgstr ""
"Den sikre forbindelse mislykkedes. Tjek at port og kryptering passer sammen "
"(587 = TLS, 465 = SSL). Hvis serveren bruger et selvsigneret certifikat, "
"skal du fjerne markeringen i \"Verificér serverens certifikat\"."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:133
msgid ""
"The server does not let this account send as the From address. Use an "
"address on a domain the account owns, and switch on \"Force From email\"."
msgstr ""
"Serveren tillader ikke, at denne konto sender som From-adressen. Brug en "
"adresse på et domæne, som kontoen ejer, og slå \"Force From email\" til."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:136
msgid "The host name does not resolve. Check it for typos."
msgstr "Værtsnavnet kan ikke opløses. Tjek det for stavefejl."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:139
msgid ""
"Read the last SERVER lines of the transcript: the server usually says "
"exactly what it did not like."
msgstr ""
"Læs de sidste SERVER-linjer i transskriptionen: serveren siger normalt "
"præcis, hvad den ikke kunne lide."

#: includes/diagnostics.php:156
msgid "No host set."
msgstr "Ingen vært angivet."

#: includes/legacy-guard.php:137
#, php-format
msgid ""
"This is the previous version of Lynbro SMTP. Lynbro SMTP Mailer has replaced "
"it and uses the same settings. Remove the folder %s with your host's file "
"manager, FTP or SSH — do not use Delete here: its uninstall erases the "
"shared SMTP settings. Lynbro SMTP Mailer keeps a backup and puts them back, "
"but the old plugin also empties the email log."
msgstr ""
"Dette er den tidligere version af Lynbro SMTP. Lynbro SMTP Mailer har "
"erstattet den og bruger de samme indstillinger. Fjern mappen %s med din "
"hosts filhåndtering, FTP eller SSH – brug ikke Slet her: afinstallationen "
"sletter de delte SMTP-indstillinger. Lynbro SMTP Mailer gemmer en "
"sikkerhedskopi og gendanner indstillingerne, men det gamle plugin tømmer "
"også e-mailloggen."

#: includes/legacy-guard.php:185
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Your SMTP settings were deleted by another plugin on %s and have been "
"restored from the backup. Nothing for you to do; send a test email if you "
"want to be sure."
msgstr ""
"Dine SMTP-indstillinger blev slettet af et andet plugin den %s og er blevet "
"gendannet fra sikkerhedskopien. Du behøver ikke gøre noget; send en "
"testmail, hvis du vil være sikker."

#: includes/log.php:314
msgid "That log entry no longer exists."
msgstr "Den logpost findes ikke længere."

#: includes/log.php:317
msgid ""
"The content of this email was not kept, so it cannot be resent. Change "
"\"Keep message content\" in Settings to resend future emails."
msgstr ""
"Indholdet af denne e-mail blev ikke gemt, så den kan ikke sendes igen. Skift "
"\"Behold beskedindhold\" i Indstillinger for at sende fremtidige e-mails "
"igen."

#: includes/log.php:324
msgid ""
"The email could not be sent again. The new attempt and its error are in the "
"log."
msgstr ""
"E-mailen kunne ikke sendes igen. Det nye forsøg og dets fejl er i loggen."

#: includes/log.php:351
msgid "Date (UTC)"
msgstr "Dato (UTC)"

#: includes/log.php:355
msgid "Recipients"
msgstr "Modtagere"

#: includes/log.php:403 includes/log.php:418
msgid "Lynbro SMTP email log"
msgstr "Lynbro SMTP-e-maillog"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:310
#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:311
msgid "Our plugins"
msgstr "Vores plugins"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:467
msgid "Image Optimizer"
msgstr "Billedoptimering"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:468
msgid ""
"Convert to WebP and AVIF, right-size oversized images and lazy-load them — "
"all on your own server."
msgstr ""
"Konverter til WebP og AVIF, tilpas store billeder og lazy-load dem – alt på "
"din egen server."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:471
msgid "AI Studio"
msgstr "AI Studio"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:472
msgid ""
"Write and illustrate posts with AI on your own OpenAI key — at cost, with no "
"credits in between."
msgstr ""
"Skriv og illustrér indlæg med AI på din egen OpenAI-nøgle – til kostpris, "
"uden mellemliggende credits."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:475
msgid "Analytics"
msgstr "Analyser"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:476
msgid ""
"Self-hosted, cookieless analytics with funnels. Visitor data never leaves "
"your database."
msgstr ""
"Selvhostet, cookiefri analyse med funnels. Besøgsdata forlader aldrig din "
"database."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:479
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "Tags"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:480
msgid ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel and more without code — each tag "
"waits for consent."
msgstr ""
"GA4, Tag Manager, Google Ads, Meta Pixel og mere uden kode – hvert tag "
"venter på samtykke."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:483
msgid "Forms"
msgstr "Formularer"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:484
msgid ""
"Forms with entries saved for free and no cap, conditional logic checked "
"server-side, and signed webhooks."
msgstr ""
"Formularer med gratis og ubegrænset gemte indsendelser, server-side betinget "
"logik og signerede webhooks."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:487
msgid "Verify"
msgstr "Verificér"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:488
msgid ""
"Catch mistyped e-mail domains and bad phone numbers, and confirm them with a "
"one-time code by e-mail or SMS."
msgstr ""
"Fang fejlindtastede e-maildomæner og forkerte telefonnumre, og bekræft dem "
"med en engangskode via e-mail eller SMS."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:491
msgid "Cache"
msgstr "Cache"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:492
msgid ""
"Reliable purging for an nginx FastCGI cache and a Redis object cache, with "
"every purge verified against the cache itself."
msgstr ""
"Pålidelig tømning af nginx FastCGI-cache og Redis objekt-cache, hvor hver "
"tømning verificeres mod selve cachen."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:495
msgid "Booking"
msgstr "Booking"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:496
msgid ""
"Appointment booking for one business on your own server: services, staff, "
"schedules, reminders and a one-click move from Amelia."
msgstr ""
"Aftalebooking til én virksomhed på din egen server: ydelser, medarbejdere, "
"tidsplaner, påmindelser og flytning fra Amelia med ét klik."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:499
msgid "Translate"
msgstr "Oversæt"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:500
msgid ""
"Run your site in several languages, with machine translation on your own "
"OpenAI key — nothing metered, nothing sold by the word."
msgstr ""
"Kør dit site på flere sprog med maskinoversættelse på din egen OpenAI-nøgle "
"– intet målt, intet solgt pr. ord."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:503
msgid "Contact Buttons"
msgstr "Kontaktknapper"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:504
msgid ""
"WhatsApp, Messenger, phone and live chat in one fast button — chat scripts "
"load only when a visitor asks."
msgstr ""
"WhatsApp, Messenger, telefon og livechat i én hurtig knap – chatscripts "
"indlæses kun, når en besøgende beder om det."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:507
msgid "Shield"
msgstr "Skjold"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:508
msgid ""
"Security headers, HTTPS with HSTS, a small firewall against injection probes "
"and the hardening switches every site needs."
msgstr ""
"Sikkerheds-headere, HTTPS med HSTS, en lille firewall mod injektionsforsøg "
"og de hærdningsindstillinger, alle sites har brug for."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:511
msgid "Anti-Spam"
msgstr "Anti-Spam"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:512
msgid ""
"Spam checks that run on your own server. No account, no subscription, every "
"block says why — and a held message is never lost."
msgstr ""
"Spamkontrol der kører på din egen server. Ingen konto, intet abonnement, "
"hver blokering forklares – og en tilbageholdt besked går aldrig tabt."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:515
msgid "Login Guard"
msgstr "Loginbeskyttelse"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:516
msgid ""
"Move wp-login.php, limit failed sign-ins and add app-based two-factor — with "
"three ways back in."
msgstr ""
"Flyt wp-login.php, begræns mislykkede logins og tilføj app-baseret to-faktor "
"– med tre måder at komme ind igen."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:519
msgid "Cookie Consent"
msgstr "Cookie-samtykke"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:520
msgid ""
"A GDPR and ePrivacy banner with Consent Mode v2, an equally prominent Reject "
"button and 35 languages."
msgstr ""
"Et GDPR- og ePrivacy-banner med Consent Mode v2, en lige så fremtrædende "
"Afvis-knap og 35 sprog."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:523
msgid "Activity Log"
msgstr "Aktivitetslog"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:524
msgid ""
"Who did what, when and from where — written down on your own server, "
"searchable, exportable, and deleted on your schedule."
msgstr ""
"Hvem gjorde hvad, hvornår og hvorfra – gemt på din egen server, søgbart, "
"eksportérbart og slettet efter din tidsplan."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:527
msgid "Data Retention"
msgstr "Databeholdning"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:528
msgid ""
"Find where personal data actually sits in your database, then delete it on a "
"schedule — with a dry run before every deletion."
msgstr ""
"Find hvor persondata faktisk ligger i din database, og slet det efter en "
"tidsplan – med prøvekørsel før hver sletning."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:531
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Tilgængelighed"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:532
msgid ""
"Scan every page against WCAG 2.2 AA and fix what can be fixed safely. No "
"overlay, no page limit."
msgstr ""
"Scan alle sider for WCAG 2.2 AA og ret det, der kan rettes sikkert. Ingen "
"overlay, ingen sideloft."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:535
msgid "Site Check"
msgstr "Hjemmeside-tjek"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:536
msgid ""
"A free website check for your visitors: HTTPS, headers, cookies before "
"consent, accessibility, SPF/DKIM/DMARC — report on screen."
msgstr ""
"Et gratis webstedstjek for dine besøgende: HTTPS, headere, cookies før "
"samtykke, tilgængelighed, SPF/DKIM/DMARC – rapport på skærmen."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:539
msgid "SEO"
msgstr "SEO"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:540
msgid ""
"Lean SEO with free LocalBusiness schema, sitemaps and social cards. Nothing "
"phones home."
msgstr ""
"Letvægts-SEO med gratis LocalBusiness-schema, sitemaps og sociale kort. "
"Intet sender data hjem."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:543
msgid "SMTP Mailer"
msgstr "SMTP-mailer"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:544
msgid ""
"WordPress email through your own SMTP server — with an email log, resend, a "
"backup connection and failure alerts."
msgstr ""
"WordPress-e-mails via din egen SMTP-server – med e-mail-log, gensend, "
"backupforbindelse og fejlalarmer."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:547
msgid "Newsletter"
msgstr "Nyhedsbrev"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:548
msgid ""
"Self-hosted newsletters with safe sending: consent records, a test after the "
"last edit and approval by typing the exact recipient count."
msgstr ""
"Selvhostede nyhedsbreve med sikker udsendelse: samtykkeregistrering, en test "
"efter den seneste redigering og godkendelse ved at indtaste det præcise "
"antal modtagere."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:551
msgid "Social Feed"
msgstr "Socialt feed"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:552
msgid ""
"An Instagram feed on your site without a Meta token stored in WordPress."
msgstr "Et Instagram-feed på dit site uden en Meta-token gemt i WordPress."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:555
msgid "Reviews Cache"
msgstr "Anmeldelses-cache"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:556
msgid "Show your Google reviews without putting an API key in WordPress."
msgstr "Vis dine Google-anmeldelser uden at lægge en API-nøgle i WordPress."

