msgstr ""
"Dansk B2B-checkout til WooCommerce: CVR-virksomhedsautoudfyldning, CVR/EU-"
"moms (VIES) validering og et EAN/GLN-felt."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:575
msgid "Danish Shipping"
msgstr "Dansk Forsendelse"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:576
msgid ""
"Free pickup point selection for PostNord and GLS Denmark at the WooCommerce "
"checkout, plus clean shipping methods."
msgstr ""
"Gratis valg af afhentningssted for PostNord og GLS Danmark ved WooCommerce-"
"checkout samt rene forsendelsesmetoder."

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:579
msgid "API Auth"
msgstr "API-godkendelse"

#: includes/lynbro-core/lynbro-core.php:580
msgid ""
"JSON Web Tokens for the REST API that you can actually revoke, with scopes "
"and a journal of refusals."
msgstr ""
"JSON Web Tokens til REST API, som du faktisk kan tilbagekalde, med scopes og "
"log over afvisninger."

