"Sends all WordPress email through your own SMTP server, with a searchable "
"email log, resend, a backup connection, failure alerts and connection "
"diagnostics. No upsells."
msgstr ""
"Sender al WordPress-e-mail via din egen SMTP-server med en søgbar e-mail-"
"log, gensendelse, en backupforbindelse, fejlalarmer og "
"forbindelsesdiagnostik. Ingen mersalg."

